The story of Zombie Attack centers on, no name soldier who tries to survive attack of hundreds of zombies, on a farm placed in the middle of nowhere. If you kill enough zombies, you can advance your character with some upgrades. Choose upgrades carefully, for you[r] fighting style. During the day zombies will be able to see you, and if that happens, he will try to follow you. During the night they will not be able to see you, however at nighttime the number of zombies walking through[t] farm is increasing. 
